Matn kelganda: ['html'] bajar: { <- (
		oʻzi
		almashtirish: ['&'] bunga: ['&amp;'],
		almashtirish: ['<'] bunga: ['&lt;'],
		almashtirish: ['>'] bunga: ['&gt;'],
		almashtirish: ['"'] bunga: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Roʻyxat yangi.

['Verbatim Syntax'] belgilar har-bir: { :son :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (son), Letter: letter).
}.

Chiqish list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list birlashtirish: ['↵']).

Chiqish yozish: template.

